      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW OLSON (6) boasts a strong record this journey here with six wins and five minors from 14 tries. Below best last time at Ballarat (22.62) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4.5 lengths fifth. Looks well placed and should feature. SHEIKH OF TWEAK (8) hit the ground running last time with a fast early split and never headed, leading throughout to win by half a length (22.32) over 390m at this track. Sure to be thereabouts. PAW SAUNDRA (2) was out of character last run when missing the frame, finishing fourth (22.57) in a Grade 5 at this track. Generally fast to begin but always back from the wide draw last time. Has a good record here at this journey. Leading chance. BUNNI BALE (1) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
